    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 102 Verbena Avenue enjoys an enviable coastal setting, combining a relaxed atmosphere with a wealth of local amenities and excellent connectivity to Dublin City. Surrounded by stunning coastline, beautiful walks and an array of recreational facilities, it is a highly sought-after location in which to live.\r\n\r\nUpon arrival, you are immediately welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hall, setting the tone for the accommodation that follows. The ground floor boasts a generously proportioned living/dining room with sliding doors opening into a conservatory, creating a wonderful sense of space and allowing natural light to flood the room. Completing the ground floor is a bright and well-appointed kitchen with a range of fitted units.\r\nUpstairs, the property provides three well-proportioned bedrooms, together with a family bathroom. The accommodation is further enhanced by a large attic conversion offering excellent additional storage space and further versatility.\r\n\r\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property's greatest attractions with a superb selection of primary and secondary schools within easy walking distance. Sutton and the surrounding area offer an excellent choice of restaurants, cafés, boutiques, salons and everyday amenities, while beautiful coastal walks are quite literally on your doorstep. Transport links are exceptional with Bayside DART Station just minutes away on foot, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre. The M1, M50 and Dublin Airport are also readily accessible, making this an ideal location for both commuters and families alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t4.67 x 2.23\tDecorative timber floor, wall feature, spotlights\r\n\r\nLounge / dining room\t7.53 x 3.35    Decorative timber floor, 2 x centre piece, coving, 2 x wall lights, fireplace with marble surround, sliding doors to conservatory\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen\t4.0 x 2.6 \tTiled floor, oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, fitted kitchen units, door to conservatory\r\n\t\t\r\nConservatory\t5.57 x 2.48\r\n\r\nStairs/Landing\t\tSpotlights, hot-press\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t2.24 x 1.68\tTiled floor & walls, spotlights, bath suite, triton electric shower, wc, whb, heated rail\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t2.63 x 2.55    Light fitting\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t3.14 x 3.5\tDouble fitted mirrored sliding Wardrope, spotlights\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.75 x 3.80\tSprig light\r\n\t\t\r\nAttic Room\t4.33 x 4.80\tVelux window, eave storage"
